  "releaseNotes": "BREAKING\n\t\t\t* The Facts of a class that read the outcome before anything else share one run, in declared order. A Fact that sets up or mentions a value first, and each Theory row, still runs alone\n\t\t\t* A Fact that changes what a later Fact reads now affects it: move one of them to a class of its own\n\t\t\t* The specification document lists a class's requirements in declared order",
